## Delivered — `VehiclePicker` (P4 shared surface 0183)

9 files at `apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/VehiclePicker.*` (1,962 lines), a faithful SwiftUI parity of `components/layout/VehiclePicker.tsx`, modeled on the existing `VehicleSelect` surface:

